  "title": "YouTube's Streaming Data Revisited",
  "summary": "YouTube will resume sharing streaming data with Billboard in 2027 after changes to the chart formula give more weight to free, ad-supported music streams. Billboard will also introduce more emphasis on ad-supported content in its calculations.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "YouTube will resume sharing streaming data with Billboard in 2027",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Free, ad-supported music streams will receive more weight in Billboard's chart calculations",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The change comes a year after YouTube applied the same approach to Shorts videos",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
